#: templates/users/integrations.html:470
msgid ""
"Only needed if your key can't reach the Playback Reporting API (e.g. a non-"
"admin key) and you'd rather not use the current-watched-state backfill above."
msgstr ""
"Solo es necesario si tu clave no puede acceder a la API de Playback "
